    <briefdescription>
<para>Consistent hash ring for distributing source identifiers across nodes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each physical node is represented by <computeroutput>virtual_nodes_per_node</computeroutput> virtual points on a 64-bit ring to achieve a more uniform distribution.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: NOT thread-safe; callers are responsible for external locking if nodes are added/removed concurrently. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
